Third-party work included or built upon:

- The Classic theme's dark background is RepriseOS's
  themes/dark/background-dark-image.png by lgreitis (5ec8799). Its dark palette
  comes from RepriseOS's payload/dark_mode.c (01c89f6) by lgreitis and Alex
  Ball (alexballvideos-netizen). GPL-3.0-only.

Apple firmware is never included. The catalog records names, sizes, offsets
and checksums of Apple's bitmaps, never their pixels. Classic's recolour rules
list the colour values of the Apple bitmaps they recolour, never their pixels.
